{"repositoryId":1400311098,"availability":"available","full":"rorshopping/shipside","name":"shipside","description":"Ship iOS apps to App Store Connect from the command line - your key, your machine, the last mile automated.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-01T16:01:39Z","updated":"2026-10-02T19:21:12Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://shipside-app.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:42:50.146Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T22:42:50.146Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T22:42:50.146Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T16:19:51.538Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"x","name":"As Seen On X.com","url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2105703756222374382","postId":"2105703756222374382","postedAt":"2026-10-01T16:57:52.000Z"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T16:19:51.538Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T22:42:50.146Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Ship iOS apps to App Store Connect from the command line — metadata, screenshots, and the actual submission, driven by the ASC REST API with your own key, on your own machine.","Not a build tool. Shipside picks up where the archive ends: it creates the version, pushes the listing, uploads screenshots, wires the age rating and review contact, attaches the build, opens the review submission — and submits. Then it tells you exactly what Apple's API refused to do and how to fix it in two clicks.","In one day — 2026-09-30 — this pipeline shipped five apps to App Review end-to-end: Adhera, Pushup Alarm, REM Sleep Alarm, InCase and RenewalRadar. That day hit every wall App Store Connect has: the 405 version-creation deadlock, an INVALIDBINARY mid-flight, the age-rating questionnaire, the 640×920 subscription screenshot trap. The full story and every playbook are in this repo and encoded in the CLI: when an API call fails in a known way, Shipside prints the exact recovery steps instead of a stack trace."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rorshopping/shipside/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e6107044493b5e1185f2b10301f63c3422a08abd37025198e83e628380a00d43","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T16:19:51.538Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T16:19:51.538Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Ship iOS apps to App Store Connect from the command line — metadata, screenshots, and the actual submission, driven by the ASC REST API with your own key, on your own machine.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rorshopping/shipside/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"e6107044493b5e1185f2b10301f63c3422a08abd37025198e83e628380a00d43","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rorshopping/shipside/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T16:19:51.538Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-02T19:21:12Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rorshopping/shipside/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T16:19:51.538Z","hash":"e6107044493b5e1185f2b10301f63c3422a08abd37025198e83e628380a00d43","originalBytes":5364,"storedBytes":5364,"truncated":false},"demoEvidence":{"kind":"x_link","repository":"rorshopping/shipside","postUrl":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2105703756222374382","url":"https://shipside-app.vercel.app/"},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://shipside-app.vercel.app/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-18T21:17:34.681Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T21:17:34.681Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-18T21:17:34.681Z","target":"https://shipside-app.vercel.app/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-25T21:17:34.681Z"},"previewCheck":{"url":"https://shipside-app.vercel.app/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-18T21:17:34.681Z","consecutiveFailures":0,"status":"captured","reason":null,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-25T21:17:34.681Z"},"screenshots":[{"src":"previews/d7bd4529d1860e628a61c9a1.jpg","kind":"demo","captured